.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-claim-keys 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-claim\-keys \- The issue keys this branch CLAIMS, as distinct from the ones it merely mentions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten claim keys\fR [\fB\-\-branch\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-log\fR] [\fB\-\-closing\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-refs\-first\-only\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
The issue keys this branch CLAIMS, as distinct from the ones it merely mentions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-branch\fR
The head branch, standing in for source 2
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR
The pull request title, also source 2 — a body is not, because a body cites evidence
.TP
\fB\-\-log\fR
Commit messages, standing in for sources 1 and 3
.TP
\fB\-\-closing\-only\fR
Answer from a closing keyword alone, never falling through to the branch or a trailer
.TP
\fB\-\-refs\-first\-only\fR
Answer from the first key of each `Refs:` trailer alone, never sources 1 or 2
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
